\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ALTERNATOR ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>9.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p><strong>- 4450B80 cap of one wheel - r+r</strong>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[512,127,0,"<p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238024\">2710A34</a></p>"],[64,127,0,"<p>Refer to op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238025\">2710A35</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the alternator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235056\">A10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nuts for the bolts fastening the alternator and partly\nrelease the bolts from the alternator rear mounting and from the\nintermediate driveshaft bearing support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069884.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Undo bolts (1a) and remove the rear alternator mounting bracket\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069885.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt securing the intermediate drive shaft bearing mounting\nto the oil sump.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the intermediate driveshaft bearing\nsupport (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069886.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the intermediate driveshaft bearing support (1a) and tighten\nthe bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DRIVE SHAFT BEARING MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankcase side) 4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Tighten the bolt securing the intermediate drive shaft bearing\nmounting to the oil sump.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069887.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>Place the lower alternator mounting bracket\nback in its housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the alternator\n to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ALTERNATOR ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ALTERNATOR ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>6.3 ÷ 7.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nalternator.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237609\">1084A16</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\